/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4861:      "docstring": "Fit a grey bar into a grey frame by aligning projections with colored columns, then stack colors above.\n\nInput structure:\n- bg, a grey structural color forming two components: a large rectangular frame (slot) and a smaller bar with upward projections.\n- Colored pixels inside the slot mark target columns.\n\nRule:\n- Move the bar upward into the slot so its bottom edge sits one cell above the slot's interior bottom.\n- Shift it horizontally so the bar's upward projections align column-wise with the colored pixels in the slot.\n- Stack the colored pixels immediately above the bar projections in each column.\n\nKey insight: The bar's projections act as keys that must align with the colored-column \"locks\" in the slot.",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4864:        "summary": "Grey horizontal bars with upward projections move upward into semi-open grey slots, aligning projections with slot openings, then colored pixels within slots move upward to align vertically with the bar's projections",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4866:        "src": "grey horizontal bar with upward vertical projections s",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4867:        "dst": "semi-open grey slot region with downward colored vertical projections d",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4868:        "match_cond": "s.projections align vertically with d.colored_projections (column positions match)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4873:        "multi_step": "Step 1: Identify grey bar s with upward projections and grey slot d with colored downward projections; Step 2: Move s upward into d such that s.projections fit into d.openings with projection-to-projection vertical alignment; Step 3: Move colored pixels upward so they align with bar projections, with bar bottom 1 cell above slot bottom",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4875:          "projection-slot alignment",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4880:        "notes": "The key geometric constraint: projections of the bar must align column-wise with the colored projections in the slot; movement distance varies based on projection lengths to achieve final alignment with 1-cell gap at bottom",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:4885:        "path2": "move(c, direction='up') such that c.projections align vertically with s.projections and s.bottom_edge is 1 cell above slot.bottom_edge",
