/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D4/3/code.py:10:#    - The D4 change is only in marker semantics: a marker may now match any
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D4/3/code.py:13:#    - Example: template colors [A, B, C], marker color B. Original generator
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D4/3/code.py:14:#      would have forced marker=A, so the first painted path cell became B.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D4/3/code.py:15:#      In the variant, marker=B means the local cycle index starts at B, so
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D4/3/code.py:20:#      unique. Repeated template colors would make "marker color -> start slot"
